(5182554, 753023, 83313, '<td valign="top">That wasn''t luck! You placed them there like that for the picture! How''s that for a creative DNMC? <br/> <br/>(Ok, just kidding. It fits the challenge well, and I like it.)</td>', 'That wasn''t luck! You placed them there like that for the picture! How''s that for a creative DNMC?  (Ok, just kidding. It fits the challenge well, and I like it.)', '2009-01-09 18:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
