(5182563, 752567, 83313, '<td valign="top">You image is way smaller than it could be. I''m sure I''m not the only one to tell you that. The image also seems excessively soft or low in contrast to me.<br/> <br/>I popped it into my image editor just to see, and some minor adjustments did give it some more pop.</td>', 'You image is way smaller than it could be. I''m sure I''m not the only one to tell you that. The image also seems excessively soft or low in contrast to me. I popped it into my image editor just to see, and some minor adjustments did give it some more pop.', '2009-01-09 18:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
