(5187452, 753202, 94876, '<td valign="top">Pretty good idea.  Maybe a tighter crop of the bow, the dogs and a bit of sea.  seems underexposed, as well.</td>', 'Pretty good idea.  Maybe a tighter crop of the bow, the dogs and a bit of sea.  seems underexposed, as well.', '2009-01-12 15:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
