(5187486, 753770, 94876, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot, lighting.  Concept seems to be a little overdone of late, but no deduction for that.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot, lighting.  Concept seems to be a little overdone of late, but no deduction for that.', '2009-01-12 15:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187488, 753819, 94876, '<td valign="top">Love the DOF, and crop.</td>', 'Love the DOF, and crop.', '2009-01-12 15:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187489, 753650, 94876, '<td valign="top">Pretty damn cool, not much else to say.  Nice capture!</td>', 'Pretty damn cool, not much else to say.  Nice capture!', '2009-01-12 15:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187490, 752627, 94876, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure of the concept, but visually, the image seems to be lacking some common elements.  Proper lighting, exposure, focus, WB, cropping.  Etc...</td>', 'I''m not sure of the concept, but visually, the image seems to be lacking some common elements.  Proper lighting, exposure, focus, WB, cropping.  Etc...', '2009-01-12 15:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187491, 753348, 94876, '<td valign="top">Hehe.  Clever concept and title.  Nicely lit and cropped.</td>', 'Hehe.  Clever concept and title.  Nicely lit and cropped.', '2009-01-12 15:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187493, 752277, 94876, '<td valign="top">I personally think a brighter exposure and a little vibrance in the colors would add so much to a nicely cropped pair.</td>', 'I personally think a brighter exposure and a little vibrance in the colors would add so much to a nicely cropped pair.', '2009-01-12 15:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187494, 752272, 94876, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of motion from the falling drops.  Not a big fan of the selective focusing.</td>', 'I like the sense of motion from the falling drops.  Not a big fan of the selective focusing.', '2009-01-12 15:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187495, 753867, 94876, '<td valign="top">Not a bad comp, IMO.  I might have titled differently myself, but no deduction there.</td>', 'Not a bad comp, IMO.  I might have titled differently myself, but no deduction there.', '2009-01-12 15:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187497, 752729, 94876, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge fan of the crop, specifically.  But there isn''t much else going on here, as well.</td>', 'I''m not a huge fan of the crop, specifically.  But there isn''t much else going on here, as well.', '2009-01-12 15:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187501, 752495, 94876, '<td valign="top">Lot''s of people have stretched the theme a little bit past where I think it should be stretched, this image included.  However, I really like the capture and the crop.  I''m a fan of the PP, as well.  Good job.  I feel this image will not be popular to the voters, but I really like it.  It''s got a uniqueness to it :) 8</td>', 'Lot''s of people have stretched the theme a little bit past where I think it should be stretched, this image included.  However, I really like the capture and the crop.  I''m a fan of the PP, as well.  Good job.  I feel this image will not be popular to the voters, but I really like it.  It''s got a uniqueness to it :) 8', '2009-01-12 15:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187504, 752567, 94876, '<td valign="top">There are several distracting elements here, and no real focal point.  Soft focus/selective focus is not working IMO.</td>', 'There are several distracting elements here, and no real focal point.  Soft focus/selective focus is not working IMO.', '2009-01-12 15:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187506, 753241, 94876, '<td valign="top">I like the crop, and lighting.  The DOF, IMO is just a tad too short.</td>', 'I like the crop, and lighting.  The DOF, IMO is just a tad too short.', '2009-01-12 15:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187508, 753540, 94876, '<td valign="top">Fancy editing, but not much else for me, personally....Unless you actually DID have the winning ticket.</td>', 'Fancy editing, but not much else for me, personally....Unless you actually DID have the winning ticket.', '2009-01-12 15:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187509, 752415, 94876, '<td valign="top">Some fancy editing, nice concept.</td>', 'Some fancy editing, nice concept.', '2009-01-12 15:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187510, 753769, 94876, '<td valign="top">Nice tight crop, good lighting.  Well photographed.</td>', 'Nice tight crop, good lighting.  Well photographed.', '2009-01-12 15:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187511, 753429, 94876, '<td valign="top">Cute capture.  I would have cropped a little tighter to the faces.  Front lighting is a tad harsh.</td>', 'Cute capture.  I would have cropped a little tighter to the faces.  Front lighting is a tad harsh.', '2009-01-12 15:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187512, 753036, 94876, '<td valign="top">Great mood in this capture.  Good crop.  I would have cloned out the dude by the falls, but then your concept would be lost, so I get it.</td>', 'Great mood in this capture.  Good crop.  I would have cloned out the dude by the falls, but then your concept would be lost, so I get it.', '2009-01-12 15:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187513, 753433, 94876, '<td valign="top">Great idea and capture.  Whoever this Marine is, give him my best.</td>', 'Great idea and capture.  Whoever this Marine is, give him my best.', '2009-01-12 15:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187515, 753343, 94876, '<td valign="top">A little sharper focus would have made this a "10" for me.  I love everything else about it.</td>', 'A little sharper focus would have made this a "10" for me.  I love everything else about it.', '2009-01-12 15:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187516, 753549, 94876, '<td valign="top">Not much that''s visually creative of interesting, IMO.</td>', 'Not much that''s visually creative of interesting, IMO.', '2009-01-12 15:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187518, 753877, 94876, '<td valign="top">Nicely cropped, great vib/sat of the colors.</td>', 'Nicely cropped, great vib/sat of the colors.', '2009-01-12 15:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187520, 752497, 94876, '<td valign="top">I like this capture, especially the angle and concept.  I feel that the bowl is distracting.  I also feel the image is a little out of focus.</td>', 'I like this capture, especially the angle and concept.  I feel that the bowl is distracting.  I also feel the image is a little out of focus.', '2009-01-12 15:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187523, 753654, 94876, '<td valign="top">Like the DOF/Sel focus, and colors.</td>', 'Like the DOF/Sel focus, and colors.', '2009-01-12 16:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187693, 752230, 22459, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. I like the prespective and duo tone.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. I like the prespective and duo tone.', '2009-01-12 17:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187829, 753363, 39919, '<td valign="top">I am SLIGHTLY bothered by the lack of letter on the star (starting point) for the game, mostly, I suppose because without following the rules of the game of scrabble, this does not demonstrate luck but rather is contrived.<br/> <br/>For me, the idea would have worked better if you had had some other word going the other way through the C and over the star.<br/> <br/>Technically, I am also bothered by the pink and blue artifacts? or is it just your board has pink and blue bleeding?<br/> <br/>Nice idea though.</td>', 'I am SLIGHTLY bothered by the lack of letter on the star (starting point) for the game, mostly, I suppose because without following the rules of the game of scrabble, this does not demonstrate luck but rather is contrived. For me, the idea would have worked better if you had had some other word going the other way through the C and over the star. Technically, I am also bothered by the pink and blue artifacts? or is it just your board has pink and blue bleeding? Nice idea though.', '2009-01-12 18:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187834, 753877, 39919, '<td valign="top">A little over exposed.</td>', 'A little over exposed.', '2009-01-12 18:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187838, 752497, 39919, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the lighting</td>', 'I don''t care for the lighting', '2009-01-12 18:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187839, 753192, 39919, '<td valign="top">I would prefer if the candy machine were also in focus.</td>', 'I would prefer if the candy machine were also in focus.', '2009-01-12 18:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187841, 752846, 39919, '<td valign="top">Not quite in focus.</td>', 'Not quite in focus.', '2009-01-12 18:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187846, 753745, 39919, '<td valign="top">Is a great smash luck? :)</td>', 'Is a great smash luck? :)', '2009-01-12 18:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187853, 753823, 39919, '<td valign="top">I would like to be able to read the writing.</td>', 'I would like to be able to read the writing.', '2009-01-12 19:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187859, 753885, 39919, '<td valign="top">I know it is hard to shoot a black cat.  However, I wish there were more detail in the cat''s coat.  Love the eyes though.</td>', 'I know it is hard to shoot a black cat.  However, I wish there were more detail in the cat''s coat.  Love the eyes though.', '2009-01-12 19:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187863, 753772, 39919, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better penny shots.</td>', 'This is one of the better penny shots.', '2009-01-12 19:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187866, 753703, 39919, '<td valign="top">I would like to seem some sunlight on them.</td>', 'I would like to seem some sunlight on them.', '2009-01-12 19:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
