(5187895, 753650, 101702, '<td valign="top">In my eyes, one of the top 3 submitted. Very simple idea and composition, but expertly envisioned.</td>', 'In my eyes, one of the top 3 submitted. Very simple idea and composition, but expertly envisioned.', '2009-01-12 19:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187917, 752273, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for food shots, and great use of colour and depth of field. One of my top 3.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for food shots, and great use of colour and depth of field. One of my top 3.', '2009-01-12 19:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187918, 752789, 101702, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot of a Coal Tit... they won''t let me get within 15 feet in my garden. Very flighty. It must have taken a lot of patience to train one to feed from the hand. Lovely and sharp where it counts and depth of field makes the subject leap from the photo. A bird in the hand indeed! Top 3 in my eyes</td>', 'Fantastic shot of a Coal Tit... they won''t let me get within 15 feet in my garden. Very flighty. It must have taken a lot of patience to train one to feed from the hand. Lovely and sharp where it counts and depth of field makes the subject leap from the photo. A bird in the hand indeed! Top 3 in my eyes', '2009-01-12 19:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187924, 753361, 101702, '<td valign="top">Lovely close up with perfect focus in the right place. Nice detail in the feathers. One of my top 5, but I suspect other would prefer it to be rotated in some way to be more pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Lovely close up with perfect focus in the right place. Nice detail in the feathers. One of my top 5, but I suspect other would prefer it to be rotated in some way to be more pleasing to the eye.', '2009-01-12 19:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187939, 753540, 101702, '<td valign="top">Very clever... I even checked the website and those are indeed the winning numbers. Either you are now one very rich photographer, or you''re very good in the art of forgery! Lol</td>', 'Very clever... I even checked the website and those are indeed the winning numbers. Either you are now one very rich photographer, or you''re very good in the art of forgery! Lol', '2009-01-12 19:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187972, 753798, 94876, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and comp.  Good color and DOF.</td>', 'Nice idea and comp.  Good color and DOF.', '2009-01-12 20:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187974, 753740, 94876, '<td valign="top">The Bokeh in this frame is distracting to me, personally.  Otherwise, great colors and interesting droplets.  Maybe a tighter crop?</td>', 'The Bokeh in this frame is distracting to me, personally.  Otherwise, great colors and interesting droplets.  Maybe a tighter crop?', '2009-01-12 20:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187976, 753363, 94876, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.  Damn, Scrabble boards are bland, aren''t they?  No fault of yours!</td>', 'Clever idea.  Damn, Scrabble boards are bland, aren''t they?  No fault of yours!', '2009-01-12 20:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187979, 753648, 94876, '<td valign="top">I see where you were trying to go, but I think it''s a bad crop, personally.  And without a clear focal point, your eyes are drawn left, right off the frame.</td>', 'I see where you were trying to go, but I think it''s a bad crop, personally.  And without a clear focal point, your eyes are drawn left, right off the frame.', '2009-01-12 20:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5187992, 753778, 94876, '<td valign="top">She''s adorable.  Great expression.  I like the comp overall, I guess I could use a bit more color, but it''s nice!</td>', 'She''s adorable.  Great expression.  I like the comp overall, I guess I could use a bit more color, but it''s nice!', '2009-01-12 20:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188000, 753772, 94876, '<td valign="top">Nice looking penny, nice and sharp, well exposed.  But I''m afraid the overall comp doesn''t fascinate me.</td>', 'Nice looking penny, nice and sharp, well exposed.  But I''m afraid the overall comp doesn''t fascinate me.', '2009-01-12 20:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188001, 753823, 94876, '<td valign="top">Firstly, Congrats!  I wish i could read the stick, but I''m presuming it''s positive?</td>', 'Firstly, Congrats!  I wish i could read the stick, but I''m presuming it''s positive?', '2009-01-12 20:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188006, 753349, 94876, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the crop, or the angle works for me here.  I think the subject is fascinating but i can''t help feeling that it could be presented in a more fascinating manner, too.</td>', 'I''m not sure the crop, or the angle works for me here.  I think the subject is fascinating but i can''t help feeling that it could be presented in a more fascinating manner, too.', '2009-01-12 20:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188019, 753470, 94876, '<td valign="top">A great capture, great crop.  Well saturated.  Lucked out with that jet contrail in the sky, it adds alot of character.  Well done! 9</td>', 'A great capture, great crop.  Well saturated.  Lucked out with that jet contrail in the sky, it adds alot of character.  Well done! 9', '2009-01-12 20:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188022, 753550, 94876, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, Nice crop.  I like the DOF, but it may be a little too shallow, IMO.</td>', 'Cool idea, Nice crop.  I like the DOF, but it may be a little too shallow, IMO.', '2009-01-12 20:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188025, 753883, 94876, '<td valign="top">This is one of the greatest feelings in the world, isn''t it?  As far as the comp, It''s a bit noisy.  Maybe bang down the ISO and leave the shutter open.  Easy fix!</td>', 'This is one of the greatest feelings in the world, isn''t it?  As far as the comp, It''s a bit noisy.  Maybe bang down the ISO and leave the shutter open.  Easy fix!', '2009-01-12 20:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188030, 753693, 94876, '<td valign="top">Bluffing helps.  The image is well exposed and nice and sharp.  The angle or crop could be more interesting to me, personally, but it''s good.</td>', 'Bluffing helps.  The image is well exposed and nice and sharp.  The angle or crop could be more interesting to me, personally, but it''s good.', '2009-01-12 20:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188037, 753012, 94876, '<td valign="top">adorable subject (the dog).  Not much else going on here.  Not an awful capture, just not very interesting.</td>', 'adorable subject (the dog).  Not much else going on here.  Not an awful capture, just not very interesting.', '2009-01-12 20:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188043, 753394, 94876, '<td valign="top">Some nice saturation.  A little underexposed.</td>', 'Some nice saturation.  A little underexposed.', '2009-01-12 20:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188046, 752976, 94876, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what''s going on here.  It''s noisy, and it looks handheld.</td>', 'I''m not really sure what''s going on here.  It''s noisy, and it looks handheld.', '2009-01-12 20:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5188049, 753282, 94876, '<td valign="top">This is average in composition.  Not very interesting in execution, IMO.</td>', 'This is average in composition.  Not very interesting in execution, IMO.', '2009-01-12 20:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
