(5190071, 752230, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is excellent, Steve!  Wonderfully composed, great perspective, definitely works in monochrome better than color (for me, anyway) so great choices made all around.  Congrats on the nifty star thingie, too!!</td>', 'This is excellent, Steve!  Wonderfully composed, great perspective, definitely works in monochrome better than color (for me, anyway) so great choices made all around.  Congrats on the nifty star thingie, too!!', '2009-01-14 01:59:46.000000', NULL, 0),
