(5190097, 752230, 28742, '<td valign="top">4th! Congrats! See - when voters lower the bar, everyone wins! ;-) You know I jest. This is a good shot and great for the challenge.</td>', '4th! Congrats! See - when voters lower the bar, everyone wins! ;-) You know I jest. This is a good shot and great for the challenge.', '2009-01-14 02:45:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5190098, 753769, 28742, '<td valign="top">Super job! Congrats on 5th!</td>', 'Super job! Congrats on 5th!', '2009-01-14 02:45:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5190100, 753348, 28742, '<td valign="top">"Low 4" - Pffft! :P</td>', '"Low 4" - Pffft! :P', '2009-01-14 02:48:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5190101, 753877, 28742, '<td valign="top">Damn right they are! Mmmmmm.</td>', 'Damn right they are! Mmmmmm.', '2009-01-14 02:49:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5190102, 752415, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well executed! I think a frog or two on the table (in full color) would have made this a contender. :)<br/> <br/><i>edit to add:</i> I forgot to tell you what my mama always told me: "Don''t play with yerself." :P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-14 02:54:11.</i></td>', 'Well executed! I think a frog or two on the table (in full color) would have made this a contender. :) edit to add: I forgot to tell you what my mama always told me: "Don''t play with yerself." :P', '2009-01-14 02:52:16.000000', '2009-01-14 02:54:11.000000', 0),
(5190103, 753202, 28742, '<td valign="top">In case she''s having second thoughts, tell your wife this woulda ribboned if it was shot with a 5D. :)</td>', 'In case she''s having second thoughts, tell your wife this woulda ribboned if it was shot with a 5D. :)', '2009-01-14 02:57:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5190151, 752230, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is great, Steve. Sepia was a good choice.</td>', 'This is great, Steve. Sepia was a good choice.', '2009-01-14 03:36:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5190162, 753650, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''re a maniac.  I love the bit about your husband wondering if you needed help then most likely quietly backing away and standing by (out of your view) with the fire extinguisher, just in case!  Beautifully lit and shot as always - you do seem to have such fun thinking these things up then executing them, and I really appreciate the fact you share your process with us.  (And you made Ken happy - fire!!!)</td>', 'You''re a maniac.  I love the bit about your husband wondering if you needed help then most likely quietly backing away and standing by (out of your view) with the fire extinguisher, just in case!  Beautifully lit and shot as always - you do seem to have such fun thinking these things up then executing them, and I really appreciate the fact you share your process with us.  (And you made Ken happy - fire!!!)', '2009-01-14 03:50:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5190170, 753650, 81530, '<td valign="top">Cool shot Irene. :)</td>', 'Cool shot Irene. :)', '2009-01-14 03:55:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5190172, 753201, 81530, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon.</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon.', '2009-01-14 03:56:08.000000', NULL, 0),
